<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Guinness estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guinness estimates raised.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earnings estimates for Guinness Plc were raised at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>For 1996, it raised its estimate for pre-tax profit to 970 million stg from 956 million, with earnings per share raised to 34.2p from 33.7p.</p>
<p>The stock was up 4p at 435 by 1137 GMT.</p>
<p>Analysts at Goldman were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
